        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Werner Jaffé, Daniel Gunkel, Klaus Servene\n- Places: Frankfurt, Hesse, Germany, Marburg, Mannheim\n- Topics: birthplaces, city description, population\n\nFacts:\n- Werner Jaffé was born in Frankfurt.\n- Klaus Servene was born in 1949 in Marburg, Hesse.\n- Daniel Gunkel was born on 7 June 1980 in Frankfurt and is a German former footballer.\n- Frankfurt is officially called Frankfurt am Main.\n- Frankfurt is a metropolis and the largest city in the German state of Hesse.\n- Frankfurt is the fifth-largest city in Germany.\n- Frankfurt had a 2015 population of 732,688 within its administrative boundaries.\n- Frankfurt had a population of 2.3 million in its urban area in 2015.\n- Klaus Servene is a German writer who lives in Mannheim.",
